      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -1077248894956463413, guid: 4c74d9b45011c0a4cb33179b186c1f73, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.character2
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -3716443579449186911, guid: 3edfa3612b371f84fb5aeb92f6fb37d2, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.soundToPlay
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainCharacterIsSpeaking
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <SFX_antiquarian_ominous_chuckle_2>... Nevermind. It was just a little
        joke.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <SFX_antiquarian_thinking>The mixture should have a <u>pH of <b>9.3</b></u>
        and <u>salinity of <b>0.87</b></u>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <b>Orchid sap</b> will <u>raise pH and lower salinity</u>, while <b>hibiscus
        sap</b> will raise <u>salinity and lower pH</u>. Also, <b>hibiscus petals</b>
        can be used to <u>neutralize the effects of both</u>, giving you a fresh
        start.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: "<SFX_antiquarian_satisfied>Here, have this <b>oil tube</b> to gather
        the oil in. Just come back to me with it and <b>I\u2019ll tell you what pH
        and salinity level you got</b>."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: "<SFX_antiquarian_satisfied>If I were you, I\u2019d test out the levels
        of the base oil you\u2019re working with first. In any case, that\u2019s
        all you need to know. Off you go, now."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
