    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - He is not one to use his tongue for conversation. One would understand him
      by the look in his eyes. Well, that is my personal experience.
    - 'He almost never speaks his thoughts in full. These days, however, I admit
      that it has been getting more and more difficult to talk to him.

'
